**Your personal intelligence layer.**
Install once, then use with any agent, any gateway, any provider, any model.

## ✨ Features

- An exclusive distribution of [ASIMOV Platform] specialized for social media
  intelligence.
- Plugs into your personal agent as a sidecar: Hermes, OpenClaw, Claude Code,
  ChatGPT Dots, etc.
- Makes social graphs transparent, disregarding typical barriers such as
  restrictive, expensive APIs.
- Currently supports **LinkedIn**, **X** (fka Twitter), **Instagram**, **Luma**,
  **GitHub**, and <sup><sub>(coming soon!)</sub></sup> more sources.
- Enriches the aforementioned public data with your own personal and/or
  organizational confidential contacts data locally, including your **Attio**
  CRM data.

## ⬇️ Installation

### Quick Installation

In a capable agent, simply copy-paste the following command to the agent:

```text
Install https://github.com/asimov-systems/asimov-alpha
```

> [!TIP]
> To upgrade an existing ASIMOV installation, simply run this command again.

<details>
<summary>Manual Installation</summary>

### Manual Installation

To install from a downloaded release tarball or zip file, follow these steps:

1. Download the [latest zip] file from the OS-specific download buttons above.

2. Instruct your personal agent (e.g., [Hermes], [OpenClaw], [Claude Code], etc.)
   to unzip the file and install the contents:

```text
Install `asimov-alpha-{{ version }}-macos-arm.zip` from my Downloads folder
```
</details>

